### ============================
### 🍽️ TABLE
### ============================

### GET all tables
GET http://localhost:9990/api/v1/table

### GET table by ID
GET http://localhost:9990/api/v1/table/28fc9cd9-7de7-446e-b460-9f509f0a23c9

### CREATE new table
POST http://localhost:9990/api/v1/table
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "min_capacity": 2,
  "max_capacity": 4,
  "image_uri": "http://localhost:9990/image/table1.jpg",
  "identifier_table": "A-01",
  "table_desc": "Table A-01",
  "is_outdoor": false,
  "is_active": true,
  "barcode": "TABLE-A-01-QR",
  "created_by": "admin",
  "updated_by": "admin",
  "owned_by": "tenant-001",
  "created_at": "2025-05-14T00:00:00.000Z",
  "updated_at": "2025-05-14T00:00:00.000Z"
}

### UPDATE table
PUT http://localhost:9990/api/v1/table/:tableId
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "max_capacity": 6,
  "identifier_table": "A-01 (updated)",
  "updated_by": "admin"
}

### DELETE table (soft delete)
DELETE http://localhost:9990/api/v1/table/:tableId
